{"parse": {"title": "中阶构想积木", "pageid": 105793, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"中阶构想积木\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/7/7d/Item-602802.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"中阶构想积木\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>中阶构想积木</b><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>1#602802</div></div><hr /><div>不知出处的荒原积木套组，渴望着以自身填补伟大设计的空缺。使用后可兑换【明日构想】内已下架的金色品阶及以下的建筑或孤屿组合。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">神秘学家千金难求的稀罕货，其积木组件可以自行跳跃。不仅能拼出宏伟的构想，更能填补那些曾被遗忘的小小角落。</div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "物品"}], "displaytitle": "中阶构想积木"}}